#, no-wrap
msgid "SQOA Solver implements the Sampling-based Quantum Optimization Algorithm with Quantum Relaxation (SQOA-QR) and surrounds it with classical preprocessing and postprocessing. This section explains the SQOA framework and how it differs from the Quantum Approximate Optimization Algorithm (QAOA).\n"
msgstr "Ipinapatupad ng SQOA Solver ang Sampling-based Quantum Optimization Algorithm with Quantum Relaxation (SQOA-QR) at nilalagyan ito ng classical preprocessing at postprocessing sa paligid. Ipinapaliwanag ng seksyong ito ang SQOA framework at kung paano ito naiiba sa Quantum Approximate Optimization Algorithm (QAOA).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
