# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get started {#get-started}"
msgstr "Magsimula {#get-started}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find access information for this Qiskit Function in the [Qiskit Functions Catalog](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions).\n"
msgstr "Hanapin ang access information para sa Qiskit Function na ito sa [Qiskit Functions Catalog](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This section shows how to authenticate and load the function, and how to prepare a problem in the dictionary format that SQOA Solver accepts by using `OptimizationProblem` from [qiskit-addon-opt-mapper](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-opt-mapper). The examples that follow run the function and read the result.\n"
msgstr "Ipinapakita ng seksyong ito kung paano mag-authenticate at mag-load ng function, at kung paano maghanda ng problema sa dictionary format na tinatanggap ng SQOA Solver gamit ang `OptimizationProblem` mula sa [qiskit-addon-opt-mapper](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-opt-mapper). Pinapatakbo ng mga susunod na halimbawa ang function at binabasa ang resulta.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authenticate and load the function {#authenticate-and-load-the-function}"
msgstr "Mag-authenticate at i-load ang function {#authenticate-and-load-the-function}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, authenticate with your [IBM Quantum API key](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/). (The following code assumes that you already [saved your account](/guides/functions-get-started#install-qiskit-functions-catalog-client) to your local environment.) Then, create a catalog client as follows:\n"
msgstr "Una, mag-authenticate gamit ang iyong [IBM Quantum API key](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/). (Ipinapalagay ng sumusunod na code na na-[save mo na ang account mo](/guides/functions-get-started#install-qiskit-functions-catalog-client) sa local environment mo.) Pagkatapos, gumawa ng catalog client gaya ng sumusunod:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare the input with `qiskit-addon-opt-mapper` {#prepare-the-input-with-qiskit-addon-opt-mapper}"
msgstr "Ihanda ang input gamit ang `qiskit-addon-opt-mapper` {#prepare-the-input-with-qiskit-addon-opt-mapper}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide models problems with the `OptimizationProblem` class of [qiskit-addon-opt-mapper](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-opt-mapper). SQOA Solver accepts a QUBO problem as a coefficient dictionary in the tuple-string format used by IBM optimization functions, so every example in this guide follows the same client-side preparation pattern:\n"
msgstr "Nagmo-model ang gabay na ito ng mga problema gamit ang `OptimizationProblem` class ng [qiskit-addon-opt-mapper](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-opt-mapper). Tumatanggap ang SQOA Solver ng QUBO problem bilang coefficient dictionary sa tuple-string format na ginagamit ng mga IBM optimization function, kaya ang bawat halimbawa sa gabay na ito ay sumusunod sa parehong client-side na pattern ng paghahanda:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Write the model.** Create an `OptimizationProblem`, add binary decision variables, and set the objective and any constraints.\n"
msgstr "**Isulat ang model.** Gumawa ng `OptimizationProblem`, magdagdag ng mga binary decision variable, at itakda ang objective at anumang constraint.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Convert to QUBO.** Convert the problem with `OptimizationProblemToQubo`, which adds any constraints to the objective as penalty terms and returns an equivalent unconstrained minimization problem.\n"
msgstr "**I-convert sa QUBO.** I-convert ang problema gamit ang `OptimizationProblemToQubo`, na nagdaragdag ng anumang constraint sa objective bilang mga penalty term at nagbabalik ng katumbas na unconstrained minimization problem.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Convert to a dictionary.** Pass the QUBO to the `to_problem_dict()` helper function defined in the next section, and pass the result to `solver.run()` as `problem`, together with `variable_type=\"binary\"`.\n"
msgstr "**I-convert sa dictionary.** Ipasa ang QUBO sa helper function na `to_problem_dict()` na tinukoy sa susunod na seksyon, at ipasa ang resulta sa `solver.run()` bilang `problem`, kasama ang `variable_type=\"binary\"`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "SQOA Solver always minimizes a dictionary problem, which matches the minimization problem that `OptimizationProblemToQubo` returns. For a maximization problem, the returned `objective_value` is therefore the negative of the original objective. To read the result in terms of the original problem, evaluate the returned assignment with `OptimizationProblem`, as the examples show. For the dictionary format details, see [Accepted problem formats](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/jij-sqoa-solver#accepted-problem-formats) in the API reference.\n"
msgstr "Laging minimina ng SQOA Solver ang isang dictionary problem, na tugma sa minimization problem na ibinabalik ng `OptimizationProblemToQubo`. Para sa maximization problem, ang ibinalik na `objective_value` ay ang negatibo ng orihinal na objective. Para mabasa ang resulta ayon sa orihinal na problema, i-evaluate ang ibinalik na assignment gamit ang `OptimizationProblem`, gaya ng ipinapakita ng mga halimbawa. Para sa mga detalye ng dictionary format, tingnan ang [Accepted problem formats](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/jij-sqoa-solver#accepted-problem-formats) sa API reference.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Define the following helper function once and reuse it in every example. It converts the QUBO returned by `OptimizationProblemToQubo` into the dictionary format. The keys use the variable indices of the QUBO, so the solution keys `x_0`, `x_1`, and so on in the result correspond to those indices. Every variable receives a linear entry, even with a zero coefficient, so that the returned solution covers all variables.\n"
msgstr "Tukuyin nang isang beses ang sumusunod na helper function at gamitin ito ulit sa bawat halimbawa. Kino-convert nito ang QUBO na ibinalik ng `OptimizationProblemToQubo` sa dictionary format. Ang mga key ay gumagamit ng mga variable index ng QUBO, kaya ang mga solution key na `x_0`, `x_1`, at iba pa sa resulta ay tumutugma sa mga index na iyon. Bawat variable ay tumatanggap ng linear entry, kahit zero ang coefficient, para saklaw ng ibinalik na solusyon ang lahat ng variable.\n"

