# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Write the model {#1-write-the-model}"
msgstr "1. Isulat ang model {#1-write-the-model}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Assign a binary variable $x_v \\in \\{0, 1\\}$ to each vertex of a graph $G = (V, E)$ to indicate its side of the cut. An edge is cut when its endpoints are on different sides, so the cut size is:\n"
msgstr "Magtalaga ng binary variable na $x_v \\in \\{0, 1\\}$ sa bawat vertex ng graph na $G = (V, E)$ para ipahiwatig ang panig nito sa cut. Ang isang edge ay na-cut kapag magkaibang panig ang mga dulo nito, kaya ang laki ng cut ay:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\mathrm{Cut}(x) = \\sum_{(u,v) \\in E} \\left(x_u + x_v - 2 x_u x_v\\right).\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\mathrm{Cut}(x) = \\sum_{(u,v) \\in E} \\left(x_u + x_v - 2 x_u x_v\\right).\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This objective is already a QUBO without constraints, so `OptimizationProblemToQubo` only turns the maximization into the equivalent minimization and keeps the variables unchanged. The `Maxcut` application class in `qiskit_addon_opt_mapper.applications` builds the same model with `Maxcut(G).to_optimization_problem()`.\n"
msgstr "Ang objective na ito ay QUBO na mismo nang walang constraint, kaya ginagawa lang ng `OptimizationProblemToQubo` na katumbas na minimization ang maximization at pinananatiling hindi nagbabago ang mga variable. Binubuo ng `Maxcut` application class sa `qiskit_addon_opt_mapper.applications` ang parehong model gamit ang `Maxcut(G).to_optimization_problem()`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
