"  - Bisitahin ang [API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/jij-sqoa-solver) para sa Qiskit Function na ito.\n"
"  - Subukan ang isang end-to-end na halimbawa sa tutorial na [maximum independent set problem](/tutorials/maximum-independent-set-jij-sqoa).\n"
"  - Alamin kung paano mag-model ng mga optimization problem gamit ang [qiskit-addon-opt-mapper](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-opt-mapper).\n"
"  - Alamin kung paano mag-model at magpalitan ng mga optimization problem gamit ang [JijModeling](https://jij-inc-jijmodeling-tutorials-en.readthedocs-hosted.com/en/latest/introduction.html) at [OMMX](https://ommx-en-book.readthedocs.io/en/latest/).\n"
"  - Basahin ang SQOA-QR paper [\\[1\\]](#references) para matuto pa tungkol sa SQOA framework.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

